          "guid": "mryk8hefov5y9h5m",
          "message": {
            "text": "The proxy is now ALWAYS applied (was: raw instance when `HOTSHEET_DISABLE_QUERY_INSTRUMENTATION=1`) specifically so `beginClusterQuery`/`endClusterQuery` run regardless of the env flag. The eviction safety invariant — never close a cluster mid-query — must not become disable-able, or a user who set that flag to escape freeze-timing would silently re-open the exact mid-query-eviction race the invariant exists to prevent. The env flag now only skips `instrumentAsync` (freeze timing), not the in-flight bookkeeping.",
            "markdown": "The proxy is now ALWAYS applied (was: raw instance when `HOTSHEET_DISABLE_QUERY_INSTRUMENTATION=1`) specifically so `beginClusterQuery`/`endClusterQuery` run regardless of the env flag. The eviction safety invariant — never close a cluster mid-query — must not become disable-able, or a user who set that flag to escape freeze-timing would silently re-open the exact mid-query-eviction race the invariant exists to prevent. The env flag now only skips `instrumentAsync` (freeze timing), not the in-flight bookkeeping."
          },
          "locations": [
